Phuc Hong Tran resolved KAFKA-16034.
------------------------------------
    Resolution: Fixed

> AsyncKafkaConsumer will get Invalid Request error when trying to rejoin on fenced/unknown member Id
> ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
>
>                 Key: KAFKA-16034
>                 URL: https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-16034
>             Project: Kafka
>          Issue Type: Sub-task
>            Reporter: Philip Nee
>            Assignee: Phuc Hong Tran
>            Priority: Major
>             Fix For: 3.8.0
>
>
> The consumer will log invalid request error when joining from fenced/unknown member id because we didn't reset the HeartbeatState and we won't send the needed fields (rebalanceTimeoutMs for example) when joining.



