Content-Type: text/plain; charset="UTF-8"
Content-Transfer-Encoding: quoted-printable

Hi Ismael,

I'm happy to see the minimum Java version moving forward, even if it's
just for the broker and tools. I hope that this encourages operators
to upgrade to 17+ across-the-board, and will make it easier to drop
support for 11 in the other modules in 5.0.

+1 (binding)

Thanks,
Greg

