The first hypothesis is that this is caused by the leaking `Options` object=
 introduced in this line:

=C2=A0

[https://github.com/apache/kafka/blob/trunk/streams/src/main/java/org/apach=
e/kafka/streams/state/internals/RocksDBStore.java#L312|https://github.com/a=
pache/kafka/pull/14852]

=C2=A0

Introduced in this PR: [https://github.com/apache/kafka/pull/14852|https://=
github.com/apache/kafka/pull/14852]



