Hi Chris,

Based on some of the offline discussions we had, people generally feel t=
hat major/minor releases have a large enough overhead that they don't wa=
nt them more frequently than every 4 months. (Obviously dot releases are=
 a different story) So Josep and I didn't want to raise the issue here.

I also feel that 4 months should be enough (for anyone? :) ) But I'm alw=
ays an optimist.

best,
Colin


