--000000000000124e97060e9d7120
Content-Type: text/plain; charset="UTF-8"
Content-Transfer-Encoding: quoted-printable

All versions in the 3.x series of Kafka will support Java 8.

Starting Kafka 4.0, we will drop support for Java 8. Clients will support
>=3D JDK 11 and other packages will support >=3D JDK 17. More details about
Java in Kafka 4.0 can be found here:
https://cwiki.apache.org/confluence/pages/viewpage.action?pageId=3D28478951=
0

Does this answer your question?

--
Divij Vaidya



