> > >> >> >> >
> > >> >> >>
> > >> >>
> > >>
> https://cwiki.apache.org/confluence/display/KAFKA/KIP-1014%3A+Managing+Un=
stable+Metadata+Versions+in+Apache+Kafka
> > >> >> >> >
> > >> >> >> > This KIP is actually already implemented in 3.7 with PR
