trol the verbosity(fan-out rate) of the metrics. It's a config with JSON fo=
rmat specifying the condition controlling fan-out of the metrics.

This task will link it to the following throughput metrics. Specifically, i=
n the event level 'high' is used, the partition dimension should be added.

