> In the current implementation the ClientMetricsManager uses LRU cache but=
 we should alos support expiring stale clients i.e. client which haven't re=
ported metrics for a while.
> =C2=A0
> The KIP mentions: This client instance specific state is maintained in br=
oker memory up to MAX(60*1000, PushIntervalMs * 3) milliseconds and is used=
 to enforce the push interval rate-limiting. There is no persistence of cli=
ent instance metrics state across broker restarts or between brokers=C2=A0



