             Summary: Delete deprecated kafka.common.MessageReader
                 Key: KAFKA-16188
                 URL: https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-16188
             Project: Kafka
          Issue Type: Task
            Reporter: Mickael Maison
